/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (High\055order\040mesh\040curving\040by\040distortion\040minimization\040with\040boundary\040nodes\040free\040to\040slide\040on\040a\0403D\040CAD\040representation)
/Author (Eloi\040Ruiz\055Gironés\054\040Xevi\040Roca\054\040Josep\040Sarrate)
/Subject (We\040propose\040a\0403D\040mesh\040curving\040method\040that\040converts\040a\040straight\055sided\040mesh\040to\040an\040optimal\055quality\040curved\040high\055order\040mesh\040that\040interpolates\040a\040CAD\040boundary\040representation\056\040The\040main\040application\040of\040this\040method\040is\040the\040generation\040of\040discrete\040approximations\040of\040curved\040domains\040that\040are\040valid\040for\040simulation\040analysis\040with\040unstructured\040high\055order\040methods\056\040We\040devise\040the\040method\040as\040follows\056\040First\054\040the\040boundary\040of\040a\040straight\055sided\040high\055order\040mesh\040is\040curved\040to\040match\040the\040curves\040and\040surfaces\040of\040a\040CAD\040model\056\040Second\054\040the\040method\040minimizes\040the\040volume\040mesh\040distortion\040with\040respect\040to\040the\040coordinates\040of\040the\040inner\040nodes\040and\040the\040parametric\040coordinates\040of\040the\040curve\040and\040surface\040nodes\056\040The\040proposed\040minimization\040features\040untangling\040capabilities\040and\040therefore\054\040it\040repairs\040the\040invalid\040elements\040that\040may\040arise\040from\040the\040initial\040curving\040step\056\040Compared\040with\040other\040mesh\040curving\040methods\054\040the\040only\040goal\040of\040the\040proposed\040residual\040system\040is\040to\040minimize\040the\040volume\040mesh\040distortion\056\040Furthermore\054\040it\040is\040less\040constrained\040since\040the\040boundary\040nodes\040are\040free\040to\040slide\040on\040the\040CAD\040curves\040and\040surfaces\056\040Hence\054\040the\040proposed\040method\040is\040well\040suited\040to\040generate\040curved\040high\055order\040meshes\040of\040optimal\040quality\040from\040CAD\040models\040that\040contain\040thin\040parts\040or\040high\055curvature\040entities\056\040To\040illustrate\040these\040capabilities\054\040we\040generate\040several\040curved\040high\055order\040meshes\040from\040CAD\040models\040with\040the\040implementation\040detailed\040in\040this\040work\056\040Specifically\054\040we\040detail\040a\040node\055by\055node\040non\055linear\040iterative\040solver\040that\040minimizes\040the\040proposed\040objective\040function\040in\040a\040block\040Gauss\205Seidel\040manner\056)
/Keywords (01\040Mar\0402016\054\040Computer\055aided\040Design\054\040T\055vertices\054\040Mesh\040generation\054\040Volume\040mesh\054\040Polygon\040mesh\054\040Boundary\040representation\054\040Polytechnic\040University\040of\040Catalonia\054\040Massachusetts\040Institute\040of\040Technology)
